<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他最近头上掉下一个水桶，醒来后说——

00:58:22.660 --> 00:58:30.150
<v Jonathan Goldstein>45 years, the heat, four shots of whiskey after the shevitz, seven, eight rubs I used to rub--
<v Jonathan Goldstein>45年，热度，蒸完桑拿后喝四杯威士忌，七、八次搓澡……

00:58:30.150 --> 00:58:54.650
